===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|zehan|lang=goh}}, from an original *{{term||tehan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*tehun||ten}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*déḱm̥t||ten}}. Compare Dutch {{term|tien|lang=nl}}, English ''[[ten]]'', Gothic [[𐍄𐌰𐌹𐌷𐌿𐌽]] (taihun).

